  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> are mid-points of sides of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> then&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#916;PQR</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>ABC</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>ABC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are cofactors of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>ABC</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>11</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#247;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>"
